WEBVTT

00:03:57.454 --> 00:04:00.163
To present metadocumentations
of our history,

00:04:00.204 --> 00:04:02.413
to give villains their origin story.

00:04:02.454 --> 00:04:04.788
Nothing and no one can be said
to be good or bad

00:04:04.788 --> 00:04:06.704
in isolation of the story around it.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.496
It's much like learning a new word.

00:04:08.538 --> 00:04:11.704
You have to use it in a sentence
for it to make sense.

00:04:11.746 --> 00:04:13.579
And then to challenge its meaning,

00:04:13.621 --> 00:04:16.913
you begin to use it
in an infinite amount of stories.

00:04:18.079 --> 00:04:19.246
Thank you.